                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What changes scaling from Rs 20L to Rs 3 Cr / month skincare?</h3>
                                        <p>10-15x transition requires: attribution depth (LTV + CAC + cohort + subscription-cohort), creative velocity (15-30/week), channel breadth, geographic expansion (India + GCC + international), Shopify architecture (Plus + headless), team structure (CMO + specialist pod), reporting cadence, retention + subscription programme.</p>
                                        <h3>What are common Rs 20L-to-Rs 3 Cr stall points?</h3>
                                        <p>(1) Ad channel saturation, (2) Creative fatigue driving CPL up, (3) Positioning too narrow, (4) SEO + content not compounding, (5) Subscription retention leak, (6) Team + agency capacity ceiling. Each with specific counter-plays.</p>
                                        <h3>What agency capabilities matter for scaling skincare?</h3>
                                        <p>Named brands scaled Rs 20L+ &rarr; Rs 3 Cr+, Rs 2 Cr+ annual ad spend management, LTV/CAC/subscription-cohort attribution, 15-30 creatives/week production, multi-channel + multi-region, Shopify Plus + headless, WhatsApp + subscription at scale, derm + celebrity + PR, retention programmes, dedicated 5-10 person pod.</p>
                                        <h3>What is realistic marketing budget for Rs 20L-to-Rs 3 Cr scaling?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 10-30 lakh / month total marketing + tech (target 20-35% revenue during scaling). Retainer Rs 2.5-5L + ad spend Rs 3-15L + creative Rs 1-2.5L + content Rs 1-2L + WhatsApp Rs 40-80K + influencer + PR Rs 1-4L + Shopify dev Rs 40K-1.5L.</p>
                                        <h3>How long does Rs 20L-to-Rs 3 Cr scaling take?</h3>
                                        <p>18-24 months well-executed. Compressed 12-18 months for outlier VC-funded brands. Longer for capital-constrained or single-channel brands.</p>
                                        <h3>Should we hire CMO during scaling?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes typically at Rs 50L-Rs 1 Cr / month revenue. CMO / head-of-growth hire (Rs 50L-Rs 1.5 Cr annual + variable) partnering with specialist agency pod is working model. Full in-house team at Rs 3+ Cr / month.</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD support scaling skincare brands?</h3>
                                        <p>5-10 person dedicated pod + creative production (15-30/week) + multi-channel + multi-region + Shopify Plus + headless + WhatsApp + subscription + derm + celebrity + PR + retention programmes + LTV / CAC / subscription-cohort + investor-grade reporting. Phase 4 Optimise + Phase 5 Scale.</p>
                                        <h3>Should we consider switching agencies during scaling?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes if current agency lacks scaling-stage capabilities. Agency-switch timing: post-Rs 50L / month revenue when new capability needs clear. Transition risk mitigate with 3-month parallel-agency handover + documented playbooks + attribution continuity.</p>
